  "claim": "Steven Harvey Goldmann directed a 2006 film that starred an American actress who appeared in Twins and Jerry Maguire. She is married to John Travolta.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Broken Bridges. Sentence: Broken Bridges is a 2006 film starring Toby Keith, Lindsey Haun, Burt Reynolds and Kelly Preston.\nPage: Kelly Preston. Sentence: Kelly Preston (born October 13, 1962) is an American actress and former model.\nPage: Kelly Preston. Sentence: She has appeared in more than sixty television and film productions, most notably including \"Mischief\", \"Twins\" and \"Jerry Maguire\".\nPage: Kelly Preston. Sentence: She is married to John Travolta, with whom she collaborated on the fantasy film \"Battlefield Earth\".\nPage: Steven Goldmann. Sentence: Goldmann also directed the movies \"Broken Bridges\" and \"Trailer Park of Terror\", and additionally directed several television programs.",
